ual completion markers. Main and secondary share one chapter advance per reply; do not finish the next chapter again during correction.\n已发生事件 maps stable names to {卷号:integer,章段:string,结果:non-empty string,参与者:string[],知情者:string[]}. Record the chapter where it happened, not a future chapter. Existing event names stay stable.\n日程 is optional and maps stable names to {类型:比赛|训练|约定|其他,日期:string,时间:string,地点:string,参与者:string[],状态:待定|已安排|进行中|已完成|已取消,说明:string}. 日期 is a real YYYY-MM-DD or empty. Plans and elapsed dates do not prove completion.\n\n【People】\nNew /人际/\u003c姓名> requires 关系:string,态度印象:string,好感:number|null,支援度:integer|null,羁绊阶段:未定|未建立|C|B|A|S,变化依据:string. Ordinary new no-change records start at 0/0 and 未建立; confirmed background may use its assessed final values. Existing values continue from their real baseline.\nOptional fields: 性别 (未知|男性|女性), 联系状态 (仅识别|已建立联系), 联系依据:string, 已加联系方式:boolean, 已知资料:{身份?,登记等级?,灵装?,已知能力?} with string children. Contact interaction and exchanged contact details are independent. Never recreate names in /系统/已删除人物.\n好感 is 0—1000; 支援度 is integer 0—320. Write justified final values and concise 变化依据. Ordinary friendliness, eased defenses and major trust changes are narrative guidance, not hard numeric tiers. No separate 好感突破依据 is required. Scores can be corrected up or down; each field remains independent. Code derives 羁绊阶段 and 恋爱阶段, which never invent actual relationship events. Do not write 名册隐藏.\n\n【Tournament T02 / T01 storage compatibility】\n/场景/选拔赛 is optional; create {} first, then business entries. Defaults: 版本:T01,赛季:破军学园选拔赛,状态:未开始,总轮次:20,代表名额:6,号池规模:288,模式:跟随系统,名册:{},比赛:{}. Use current system protagonist mode; do not set a separate player mode.\n名册/\u003cID>: {姓名:string,来源:正典|原创|玩家,参赛状态:参赛|退选|取消资格,入赛轮次?:integer(1..20)}. Preserve legacy 初始战绩 but never create or change it via AI; only the user's manual recovery form may do so.\n比赛/\u003cID>: {轮次:integer,甲方:rosterID,乙方:rosterID,日期:string,时间:string,地点:string,状态:待定|已安排|已完成|已取消,胜者?:r